@InstaSafe_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List orders
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### Create order
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorPhone": "08012345678",
  "customerName": "Chidi",
  "customerPhone": "08087654321",
  "deliveryAddress": "Lekki",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Sneakers", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceKobo": 2250000 }
  ],
  "amountKobo": 4500000,
  "currency": "NGN"
}

###

### Parse order text
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Order: 2 pairs of sneakers for Chidi, 08012345678, Lekki, 45000"
}

###

### Register vendor (step 1: profile + password -> email OTP sent)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/vendors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08012345678",
  "displayName": "Ada Boutique",
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Obi",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "s3cretPass!"
}

###

### Verify email (step 1b)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/auth/vendor/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Resend email code
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/auth/vendor/request-email-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com"
}

###

### Vendor login (phone OR email + password)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/auth/vendor/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginId": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "s3cretPass!"
}

###

### Get vendor by phone
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/vendors/by-phone?phone=08012345678
Accept: application/json

###

### List vendors
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/vendors?page=1&pageSize=20&activeOnly=true
Accept: application/json

###

### Request vendor login code (public)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/auth/vendor/request-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08012345678"
}

###

### Verify login code -> JWT (public)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/auth/vendor/verify-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08012345678",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Authed example: my vendor profile (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/vendors/by-phone?phone=08012345678
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_HERE

###

### Guest example: track order by reference (no auth)
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders/by-reference/ref-123
Accept: application/json

###

### Register dispatcher (public)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/dispatch/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08055556666",
  "firstName": "Musa",
  "lastName": "Rider",
  "accountNumber": "0123456789",
  "bankCode": "058"
}

###

### Driver assigned deliveries (Authorization: Bearer <driver-jwt>)
GET {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/dispatch/assigned
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_DRIVER_JWT_HERE

###

### Driver confirm delivery (driver JWT + buyer OTP)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/dispatch/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_DRIVER_JWT_HERE

{
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### Buyer confirm satisfaction, digital order (no auth)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm-satisfaction
Accept: application/json

###

### Buyer file dispute (no auth)
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/dispute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Wrong item delivered"
}

###

### Vendor resolve dispute (vendor JWT): {"resolution":"release"} or {"resolution":"refund"}
POST {{InstaSafe_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resolve-dispute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_HERE

{
  "resolution": "release"
}

###

